    'services.mobile.pricingTitle': 'How much does mobile app development cost',
    'services.mobile.intro': 'Professional mobile app development for iOS and Android in Almaty, Astana, Shymkent and throughout Kazakhstan. We create native and cross-platform mobile applications that provide excellent user experience.',
    'services.mobile.content': 'We develop mobile applications for iOS and Android platforms - from simple utility apps to complex business solutions with backend integration. Over 6 years of experience and 38+ completed projects. Mobile app development in Kazakhstan is our specialty. We work with clients throughout Kazakhstan, creating mobile solutions that help businesses reach their customers on mobile devices.\n\nOur services include:\n\nNative iOS Apps\nNative iOS applications developed with Swift and SwiftUI. Full integration with iOS features, App Store optimization, and modern iOS design guidelines. Perfect performance and native user experience.\n\nNative Android Apps\nNative Android applications developed with Kotlin and Jetpack Compose. Material Design guidelines, Google Play optimization, and integration with Android services.\n\nCross-Platform Apps\nCross-platform mobile applications using React Native or Flutter. Single codebase for iOS and Android, faster development, cost-effective solution. Perfect for startups and businesses that need apps for both platforms.\n\nHybrid Apps\nHybrid mobile applications using web technologies (React, Vue) wrapped in native containers. Cost-effective solution for simple to medium complexity apps.\n\nApp Maintenance and Updates\nOngoing mobile app maintenance: updates, bug fixes, new feature additions, performance optimization, and App Store/Google Play submissions.\n\nAll mobile apps are created with:\n- Native or cross-platform technologies (Swift, Kotlin, React Native, Flutter)\n- Modern UI/UX design\n- Backend integration and API connections\n- Push notifications\n- App Store and Google Play optimization\n- Security and performance optimization',
    'services.mobile.process': 'Our mobile app development process:\n\n1. Consultation and requirements analysis\n2. Platform selection (iOS, Android, or both)\n3. Design and prototyping\n4. Development and backend integration\n5. Testing on devices\n6. App Store/Google Play submission\n7. Launch and ongoing support',
    'services.mobile.examples': 'Examples of completed mobile app projects:\n\n- Na\'Vi Connect - Mobile app for event management\n- Business utility apps for internal processes\n- E-commerce mobile applications',
    'services.mobile.faq.0.question': 'How long does it take to develop a mobile app?',
    'services.mobile.faq.0.answer': 'Development time depends on complexity. A simple app takes 1-2 months, a medium complexity app - 2-4 months, a complex app with backend - 4-6 months. Cross-platform apps can be developed faster.',
    'services.mobile.faq.1.question': 'Which platform should I choose: iOS, Android, or both?',
    'services.mobile.faq.1.answer': 'We recommend starting with the platform where your target audience is most active. For Kazakhstan, Android has a larger market share, but iOS users often have higher purchasing power. Cross-platform development allows creating apps for both platforms simultaneously.',
    'services.mobile.faq.2.question': 'What technologies do you use?',
    'services.mobile.faq.2.answer': 'We use native technologies (Swift for iOS, Kotlin for Android) and cross-platform frameworks (React Native, Flutter). We choose the best technology based on project requirements, budget, and timeline.',
    'services.mobile.faq.3.question': 'Do you help with App Store and Google Play submission?',
    'services.mobile.faq.3.answer': 'Yes, we help with app submission to App Store and Google Play, including preparing screenshots, descriptions, keywords, and handling the review process.',
    'services.mobile.faq.4.question': 'Can you integrate the app with existing backend?',
    'services.mobile.faq.4.answer': 'Yes, we can integrate mobile apps with existing backends, APIs, and third-party services. We work with REST APIs, GraphQL, and various authentication systems.',
    'services.mobile.faq.5.question': 'How much does mobile app development cost?',
    'services.mobile.faq.5.answer': 'As a guide: an MVP starts from 800 000 ₸, a native iOS or Android app from 1 200 000 ₸, a full-featured app from 1 500 000 ₸, and a complex product with a backend from 2 500 000 ₸. We prepare an exact estimate after a brief and the feature list for the first version.',
    'services.mobile.faq.6.question': 'Do you provide app maintenance?',
    'services.mobile.faq.6.answer': 'Yes, we provide ongoing app maintenance: updates, bug fixes, new features, performance optimization, and App Store/Google Play updates. Flexible maintenance packages depending on your needs.',
    
