    'services.mobile.cards.0.description': 'Native iOS applications developed with Swift and SwiftUI. Full integration with iOS features, App Store optimization, and modern iOS design guidelines.',
    'services.mobile.cards.0.extended': 'We develop native iOS applications for businesses in Almaty, Astana, Shymkent and throughout Kazakhstan. Swift and SwiftUI development, full iOS feature integration, App Store optimization, modern iOS design guidelines. Perfect performance and native user experience. Working with businesses throughout Kazakhstan.',
    
